{"id":"ba3b191d87bb028c","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-singleton-map.md","title":"幂对象的单元素映射","display":"df-singleton-map — 幂对象的单元素映射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-singleton-map","aliases":["16-df-singleton-map","Singleton map"],"display":"df-singleton-map — 幂对象的单元素映射","depends_on":["[[16-df-power-object]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Notation 5.4.3 p.341 (PDF361); local power-object formulation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-singleton-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-singleton-map</span><span>Singleton map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-singleton-map — 幂对象的单元素映射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f1736212b369c916\" href=\"?note=f1736212b369c916\" title=\"16-df-power-object\">16-df-power-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Notation 5.4.3 p.341 (PDF361); local power-object formulation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 具有指定有限极限。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)\">\\(D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)\">\\(\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f1736212b369c916\" href=\"?note=f1736212b369c916\" title=\"16-df-power-object\">16-df-power-object</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_I=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\to I\\times I\">\\(\\delta_I=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\to I\\times I\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_D:I\\to P\">\\(s_D:I\\to P\\)</span> 由下文唯一分类条件确定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;a,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;a,x)\\)</span> 的参数域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,P)\">\\(a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,P)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,I)\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,I)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\{s_D\\}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{r\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,P)\\ \\Bigm|\\\n(\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,M))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(\\delta_I,k;r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I,\\epsilon)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;a,x)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,M))\\\n\\epsilon h=\\langle a,x\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\{s_D\\}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{r\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,P)\\ \\Bigm|\\\n(\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,M))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(\\delta_I,k;r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I,\\epsilon)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;a,x)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,M))\\\n\\epsilon h=\\langle a,x\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对角线是单态，所以幂对象的泛性质保证分类箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_D\">\\(s_D\\)</span> 存在且唯一；单元素集合定义式因而有确定的左侧元素。成员关系用通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 的分解定义，适用于所有广义元素，不以全局元素替代一般语境。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\Omega^I\">\\(P=\\Omega^I\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为评价的真值拉回，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_D\">\\(s_D\\)</span> 是对角线特征箭头的指数转置，正是原书 Notation 5.4.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\}_I\">\\(\\{\\}_I\\)</span>。本页用幂对象泛性质统一同一构造；与类型论的理解函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{-\\}:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(\\{-\\}:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 不共用签名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-power-object","status":"resolved","id":"f1736212b369c916","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-power-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-power-object","status":"resolved","id":"f1736212b369c916","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 具有指定有限极限。$D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)$，采用 [[16-df-power-object]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\delta_I=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\to I\\times I$；$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。$s_D:I\\to P$ 由下文唯一分类条件确定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowerObj}_{\\mathcal E}(I;P,M,\\epsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_I=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_I,\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle:I\\to I\\times I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"s_D:I\\to P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;a,x)","display":false},{"tex":"J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,P)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\{s_D\\}\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{r\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,P)\\ \\Bigm|\\\n(\\exists k\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(I,M))\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal E}(\\delta_I,k;r\\times\\operatorname{id}_I,\\epsilon)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Mem}_D(J;a,x)\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\exists h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(J,M))\\\n\\epsilon h=\\langle a,x\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"s_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\Omega^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"s_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\{-\\}:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false}],"bytes":1983,"backlinks":[{"id":"6ac92fdbbf9c7872","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D=(\\mathcal E,I,P,M,\\epsilon)$ 为 [[16-df-singleton-map]] 的数据；$\\mathcal E$ 具有有限极限，$\\epsilon$ 是 $I$ 的幂对象成员关系。$s_D$ 与 $\\operatorname{Mem}_D$ 采用该定义。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map-category]]、[[16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-dependent-product]]、[[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]]、[[16-df-power-object]]、[[16-df-singleton-map]]、[[16-lem-singleton-monic]]、[[16-thm-power-object]]。最小伴随存在性与完整含BC的理解积分别保留；singleton单态性用任意广义元素证明。"}],"outgoing":["f1736212b369c916","b75e7c168ac56b22","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}